*hld*.md
*hld*.docx
*[Aa][Ss][Bb][Uu][Ii][Ll][Tt]*.md
*[Aa][Ss][Bb][Uu][Ii][Ll][Tt]*.docx
*bpa-*.md
*ncsc-*.md
tenant-*.md
# Customer-name-prefixed report globs live in .git/info/exclude (local only)
# so customer identifiers never appear in this published file.

